		"This path leads to the &eCulinary&r branch."
		""
		"Follow the marker to open that quest line."
	]
	quest.11D05E3CE2B7E750.quest_subtitle: "Branch marker"
	quest.11D05E3CE2B7E750.title: "Path: Culinary"
	quest.11D0ACCB0E10BB07.quest_desc: [
		"This path leads to the &eCreate: Cogs \& Crates&r branch."
		""
		"Follow the marker to open that quest line."
	]
	quest.11D0ACCB0E10BB07.quest_subtitle: "Branch marker"
	quest.11D0ACCB0E10BB07.title: "Path: Cogs \& Crates"
	quest.11E9CC6C443AC051.quest_desc: [
		"This path leads to the &eAdventure&r branch."
		""
		"Follow the marker to open that quest line."
	]
	quest.11E9CC6C443AC051.quest_subtitle: "Branch marker"
	quest.11E9CC6C443AC051.title: "Path: Adventure"
	quest.11F2E207DC27FDC7.quest_desc: [
		"This path leads to the &eCreate: Rotational Power&r branch."
		""
		"Follow the marker to open that quest line."
	]
	quest.11F2E207DC27FDC7.quest_subtitle: "Branch marker"
	quest.11F2E207DC27FDC7.title: "Path: Rotational Power"
	quest.11F3534AE5D06169.quest_desc: [
		"This path leads to the &eCreate: Sparks \& Circuits&r branch."
		""
		"Follow the marker to open that quest line."
	]
	quest.11F3534AE5D06169.quest_subtitle: "Branch marker"
	quest.11F3534AE5D06169.title: "Path: Sparks \& Circuits"
	quest.11F862B29B31518C.quest_desc: [
		"This path leads to the &eOtherside&r branch."
		""
		"Follow the marker to open that quest line."
	]
	quest.11F862B29B31518C.quest_subtitle: "Branch marker"
	quest.11F862B29B31518C.title: "Path: Otherside"
	quest.12B850B5CC9D04E0.quest_desc: [
		"The &aSilver Dungeon&r hides in the clouds, home to the Valkyries and a &aSilver Dungeon Key&r."
		""
		"Claim a Silver Dungeon Key."
		""
		"Only a proven trainer survives the Valkyrie Queen."
	]
	quest.12B850B5CC9D04E0.quest_subtitle: "The Silver Dungeon"
	quest.130C627C6A5F1EBB.quest_desc: ["Raises the accuracy of the holder's moves by 10 percent."]
	quest.137AB3330219C4EF.quest_desc: [
		"Not every held item is about damage. Defensive items keep your Pokemon standing when the odds are against them."
		""
		"A &aFocus Sash&r lets a Pokemon survive any one hit from full health with 1 HP. The &aAssault Vest&r boosts Special Defense, and &aEviolite&r hugely bolsters an unevolved Pokemon."
		""
		"Obtain these defensive tools to round out a balanced team."
	]
	quest.137AB3330219C4EF.quest_subtitle: "Survive what should have killed you"
	quest.13E7C3F47FA3A2F1.quest_desc: ["Changes a Pokemon's nature to Naughty, reshaping its stat spread without re-breeding."]
	quest.13F6FFD1A29A1126.quest_desc: ["A Utility+ cap that guarantees a high Speed IV floor."]
	quest.1490B18DC7964605.quest_desc: ["A dry food berry, the dry member of the flavor-heal family. Best put to use in the kitchen."]
	quest.160AD5DDFCD12842.quest_desc: ["A corn-shaped food berry with no battle effect, good for cooking and juices."]
	quest.1625B3BD9C78D8C4.quest_desc: ["A rich, sweet food berry used purely in cooking and treats."]
	quest.163F89F9BD994CEA.quest_desc: ["Held item that damages an attacker back when the holder is hit by a physical move. Chip revenge on aggressive foes."]
	quest.170A01C2CACC7EEB.quest_desc: [
		"The &aPrecision Mechanism&r is the core of every advanced Create machine: Deployers, Mechanical Arms, Trains and more."
		""
		"Assemble one on a &aMechanical Crafter&r array from Brass Sheets, cogwheels and an iron nugget."
		""
		"Craft your first Precision Mechanism. You have mastered the basics of Create."
	]
	quest.170A01C2CACC7EEB.quest_subtitle: "The gateway to automation"
	quest.176442F9DCC8290F.quest_desc: ["Damages attackers that make contact with the holder. Punishes physical attackers."]
	quest.177CD3E5CB58423C.quest_desc: ["A shiny Utility+ Attack cap variant."]
	quest.17CEA112FD730299.quest_desc: [
		"The &aMechanical Mixer&r over a &aBasin&r combines ingredients, halves the cost of Andesite Alloy, and, when heated, alloys metals."
		""
		"Build a Mixer and a Basin and power the Mixer with rotation."
		""
		"You are about to make Brass."
	]
	quest.17CEA112FD730299.quest_subtitle: "Mixing in a Basin"
	quest.17CFE63D9CCD4A62.quest_desc: ["A sweet food berry from the flavor-heal family. Sweet-tooth Pokemon love it; great for recipes."]
	quest.17DD46F32F55CB95.quest_desc: [
		"You have the tools, the team, and the know how. Now build a real collection."
		""
		"Catch &a10 Pokemon&r in total to complete your first steps as a Steamon Trainer."
		""
		"The League awaits. This is only the beginning."
	]
	quest.17DD46F32F55CB95.quest_subtitle: "Become a true Trainer"
	quest.17E6A8EE94843D92.quest_desc: ["Adds a single Speed EV to hit a precise benchmark."]
	quest.183BDF232B778A6E.quest_desc: ["A tart food berry with no battle effect. Grow it on a plot and use it in cooking and berry recipes."]
	quest.18625E0A72A07F84.quest_desc: ["An enormous, very sweet food berry. A dessert staple in the kitchen, no battle effect."]
	quest.18646D37EA26C626.quest_desc: ["Swaps a Pokemon's Ability to its Hidden Ability. Highly sought after."]
	quest.188AE9C67B19D68A.quest_desc: ["Locks the holder into one move but boosts its Speed by 50 percent."]
	quest.18D3CED4A6ED20C3.quest_desc: ["Adds Special Attack EVs. Core vitamin for special sweepers."]
	quest.1999103A28608AC3.quest_desc: ["A simple berry drink that restores a little HP. Craftable from berries."]
	quest.1999C22F426BB20D.quest_desc: ["Halves one super-effective Water-type hit. Buys a Fire, Ground or Rock type a turn to strike back."]
	quest.19F9D702E551404C.quest_desc: ["A refreshing Apricorn juice brewed from green Apricorns."]
	quest.1A18EF9AC0DDE038.quest_desc: ["Changes a Pokemon's nature to Lax, reshaping its stat spread without re-breeding."]
	quest.1A925D76A2FF78D3.quest_desc: [
		"You have conquered the Nether. Forge a full &aNetherite&r milestone to prove it."
		""
		"Craft a Netherite tool or piece of armor from your hard won ingots."
		""
		"With the Nether behind you, the End awaits."
	]
	quest.1A925D76A2FF78D3.quest_subtitle: "Master of the fire realm"
	quest.1A93AD935EE3EDF2.quest_desc: ["A bitter herbal powder that cures all status conditions cheaply."]
	quest.1AC65393D96E9678.quest_desc: ["Revives a fainted Pokemon with full HP. The premium revival item."]
	quest.1AF90F28483C7B8D.quest_desc: ["A light stone held item that halves the holder's weight for weight-based moves."]
	quest.1B467E5FA96BDA7D.quest_desc: [
		"The &aBronze Dungeon&r is guarded by the Slider. Beat it to earn a &aBronze Dungeon Key&r and its loot."
		""
		"Claim a Bronze Dungeon Key."
		""
		"The dungeons hold the Aether's finest treasures."
	]
	quest.1B467E5FA96BDA7D.quest_subtitle: "The Bronze Dungeon"
	quest.1B917470468262BB.quest_desc: ["Changes a Pokemon's nature to Lonely, reshaping its stat spread without re-breeding."]
	quest.1BA9F8118A2405A6.quest_desc: [
		"Prove you have truly explored. Catch &a8 Pokemon&r across the overworld."
		""
		"Range across biomes to find variety. Grass, water, cave and mountain species all count."
		""
		"A broad team is a strong team."
	]
	quest.1BA9F8118A2405A6.quest_subtitle: "A team from every corner"
	quest.1BC2713197791E48.quest_desc: [
		"The overworld of Steamon is packed with new biomes, structures and Pokemon."
		""
		"This is your home base. From here you will reach the Nether, the End, the Aether and the Otherside."
		""
		"Start by gathering &awood and stone&r and getting on your feet."
	]
	quest.1BC2713197791E48.quest_subtitle: "Your world is bigger than it looks"
	quest.1BD4D2B56502E419.quest_desc: ["A Utility+ void Speed cap."]
	quest.1BFA2B372F6E2B48.quest_desc: ["Halves one super-effective Grass-type hit, easing the Grass weakness of Water, Ground and Rock types."]
	quest.1C0F43010C872618.quest_desc: ["A mysterious berry that heals the holder when hit by a super-effective move. Rare, powerful, and hard to grow."]
	quest.1C89D1B5A2D65844.quest_desc: [
		"The Otherside is carved from &aGloomslate&r and &aSculk Stone&r. Mine it to build in this shadowed world."
		""
		"Collect a stack of Cobbled Gloomslate."
		""
		"Its tools and armor rival the overworld's best."
	]
	quest.1C89D1B5A2D65844.quest_subtitle: "Stone of the other realm"
	quest.1D1EE056126AAA28.quest_desc: ["A soft blue food berry used in cooking and dyes. Purely culinary, no battle use."]
	quest.1D8B9F9A896BBBD8.quest_desc: [
		"The Otherside hides rare &aDragon and Paradox&r Pokemon. Catch a &aDragon type&r here."
		""
		"The strangest species from the spawn pack lurk in the deepest dark."
		""
		"A Beast Ball may be your best chance."
	]
	quest.1D8B9F9A896BBBD8.quest_subtitle: "Dragons and paradoxes"
	quest.1E952BD01475D2F6.quest_desc: ["A Utility+ void Attack cap."]
	quest.1FB03D40A5F26F5E.quest_desc: ["Halves one super-effective Steel-type hit. Useful on Ice, Rock and Fairy types weak to Steel."]
	quest.1FB3D299115C8958.quest_desc: [
		"The Aether teems with &aFlying type Pokemon&r drifting between islands. Catch &a2 Flying types&r here."
		""
		"Flying types rule the open skies of this dimension."
		""
		"Watch your footing, the drop is a long one."
	]
	quest.1FB3D299115C8958.quest_subtitle: "Wings among the clouds"
	quest.1FE091D678CD5052.quest_desc: ["Held by Clamperl it evolves into Gorebyss, and boosts Special Defense."]
	quest.1FE371A587F832EC.quest_desc: ["An eerie cloth that evolves Dusclops into Dusknoir on trade."]
	quest.1FE67AB5B5252619.quest_desc: ["A tangy yellow Apricorn juice."]
	quest.1FE6F0C60B6EF704.quest_desc: ["Changes a Pokemon's nature to Timid, reshaping its stat spread without re-breeding."]
	quest.1FF558FFC63724B4.quest_desc: ["A Utility+ void cap, the top-tier HP IV guarantee."]
	quest.20015467B3A63340.quest_desc: [
		"The &aPrinter&r duplicates written books and enchanted books using ink and liquid experience."
		""
		"Mass-produce your best enchantments once you have the recipe dialed in."
		""
	]
	quest.20015467B3A63340.quest_subtitle: "Copy your books"
	quest.2002A559B5E40733.quest_desc: [
		"Prefer the sky to the river? A &aWindmill Bearing&r spins a sail contraption made of wool or sails."
		""
		"Bigger sails, more power. A clean alternative when no water is nearby."
		""
	]
	quest.2002A559B5E40733.quest_subtitle: "Catch the wind instead"
	quest.2008DD0A6FF59772.quest_desc: [
		"A pair of &aCrushing Wheels&r spun in opposite directions shreds anything dropped between them, doubling most ore yields."
		""
		"The backbone of any serious ore-processing line."
		""
	]
	quest.2008DD0A6FF59772.quest_subtitle: "Double your ores"
	quest.2011B7295E3AD0E8.quest_desc: ["Halves Speed but adds Defense EVs after battle."]
	quest.2012AD441F050A12.quest_desc: [
		"The &aMechanical Press&r pounds ingots into &aSheets&r and compacts materials. Mount it over a &aBasin&r or a &aDepot&r."
		""
		"Sheets of iron, brass and copper feed almost every advanced recipe. This machine is unavoidable."
		""
	]
	quest.2012AD441F050A12.quest_subtitle: "Stamp out plates"
	quest.20194D83090E4E55.quest_desc: [
		"The &aElectric Motor&r does the reverse: it consumes FE to produce rotation on demand, with adjustable speed."
		""
		"Store power when you have surplus, spend it when you need a burst. The heart of a hybrid setup."
		""
	]
	quest.20194D83090E4E55.quest_subtitle: "FE back into rotation"
	quest.202A9BD1C81F243A.quest_desc: [
		"The &aAlternator&r turns rotational force into electricity. Spin it fast with a water wheel or windmill to generate FE."
		""
		"This is your first generator. Everything electric downstream needs it."
		""
	]
	quest.202A9BD1C81F243A.quest_subtitle: "Rotation into FE"
	quest.202BE63206C547AC.quest_desc: [
		"&aCreate: Stuff and Additions&r adds &aJetpacks&r. Start with the &aCopper Jetpack&r and work up to the &aNetherite Jetpack&r for full flight."
		""
		"Fuelled by your Create power infrastructure. Freedom of movement, endgame style."
		""
	]
	quest.202BE63206C547AC.quest_subtitle: "Take to the skies"
	quest.202DEA1408818B44.quest_desc: [
		"The &aAccumulator&r stores FE for later. Chain several, or build a &aModular Accumulator&r, to hold a serious reserve."
		""
		"Buffer your generators so machines never stall when the wind drops."
		""
	]
	quest.202DEA1408818B44.quest_subtitle: "Bank your power"
	quest.203EA3D6CDF9263E.quest_desc: [
		"&aCreate: Dragons Plus&r adds dragon-breath processing and the &aBlaze Upgrade Smithing Template&r for upgraded blaze gear."
		""
		"A fitting capstone: you slew the dragon, now you industrialize its fire."
		""
	]
	quest.203EA3D6CDF9263E.quest_subtitle: "Harness dragon fire"
	quest.204115B912BAFEEF.quest_desc: [
		"Assemble a multiblock &aReactor&r from casing, a controller, core, cooler and input/output ports. Fuelled with uranium, it produces enormous heat and power."
		""
		"This is the single most powerful energy source in Steamon. Cool it well or it melts down."
		""
	]
	quest.204115B912BAFEEF.quest_subtitle: "Build a nuclear reactor"
	quest.20426A4BA2350D92.quest_desc: ["Changes a Pokemon's nature to Quiet, reshaping its stat spread without re-breeding."]
	quest.20438DB0F60F2253.quest_desc: [
		"&aCreate Compressed&r adds compressed material blocks. Press or craft sheets into &aSheet Blocks&r for compact storage and new recipes."
		""
		"A neat way to store bulk metal output from your presses."
		""
	]
	quest.20438DB0F60F2253.quest_subtitle: "Pack it tighter"
	quest.20446249E22B29B0.quest_desc: [
		"&aEnder Transmission&r adds wireless transmitters for items, fluids and energy across any distance, plus a &aChunk Loader&r to keep it running."
		""
		"Link a base and an outpost without a single wire between them."
		""
	]
	quest.20446249E22B29B0.quest_subtitle: "Send power anywhere"
	quest.20483FEDF2CD20B5.quest_desc: [
		"You know the overworld. Now the other dimensions call."
		""
		"Assemble &aObsidian&r and prepare to light your first portal."
		""
		"The Nether is your next destination."
	]
	quest.20483FEDF2CD20B5.quest_subtitle: "Ready for the beyond"
	quest.204D78A5D6475BBF.quest_desc: [
		"&aEnchantment Industry&r lets you pump liquid &aExperience&r and automate enchanting with the &aBlaze Enchanter&r and &aPrinter&r."
		""
		"Turn a mob farm XP into fluid, then enchant and print books at industrial scale."
		""
	]
	quest.204D78A5D6475BBF.quest_subtitle: "Automate enchanting"
	quest.205AE059EFBB160A.quest_desc: [
		"An &aEncased Fan&r pushes air through blocks to process items: fire smelts, water washes, lava smokes. Place a Blaze Burner in front to smelt for free."
		""
		"One fan replaces a whole row of furnaces. Washing gravel and ores is where it shines."
		""
	]
	quest.205AE059EFBB160A.quest_subtitle: "Air does the work"
	quest.2065E15A157AB684.quest_desc: [
		"Reactors need fuel. Mine &aUranium Ore&r, process it into &aYellowcake&r and refine &aUranium Rods&r."
		""
		"Handle it with care and wear &aAnti-Radiation&r gear when things get hot."
		""
	]
	quest.2065E15A157AB684.quest_subtitle: "Mine the unstable stuff"
	quest.206989E928EDBBA1.quest_desc: [
		"The &aPrecision Mechanism&r is Create advanced crafting component, assembled from cogs, a golden sheet and iron nuggets."
		""
		"Deployers, mechanical arms and most automation blocks demand it. Making a few is a real milestone."
		""
	]
	quest.206989E928EDBBA1.quest_subtitle: "Clockwork in a box"
	quest.206E8BE76893FB18.quest_desc: [
		"Create ships a full train system. &aTrain Track&r is bent and placed with the track item, following any curve you draw."
		""
		"This optional branch is your gateway to bogeys, stations and cross-map cargo trains."
		""
	]
	quest.206E8BE76893FB18.quest_subtitle: "Lay down some rails"
	quest.207A81A64CBCE64F.quest_desc: [
		"&aCreate&r turns raw rotation into automation. It all starts with &aAndesite Alloy&r: andesite plus iron nuggets, or wash gravel and combine."
		""
		"Craft a stack. Almost every Create recipe wants it."
		""
		"&eThis milestone opens the Cogs and Crates branch.&r"
	]
	quest.207A81A64CBCE64F.quest_subtitle: "The heart of every machine"
	quest.208376490BBB8C2B.quest_desc: [
		"&aBelts&r are placed by right-clicking two shafts with the belt item. They carry items and even players across your factory."
		""
		"Combine with &aFunnels&r and &aChutes&r to load and unload machines automatically."
		""
	]
	quest.208376490BBB8C2B.quest_subtitle: "Move items around"
	quest.208FB0F149A17EDF.quest_desc: [
		"The &aMechanical Mixer&r over a &aBasin&r combines items and fluids, and smelts alloys like &aBrass&r."
		""
		"Set your heat with a &aBlaze Burner&r underneath for recipes that need it."
		""
	]
	quest.208FB0F149A17EDF.quest_subtitle: "Mix, wash and alloy"
	quest.209D0560ED3D4C5F.quest_desc: [
		"&aAndesite Casing&r is the base building block of Create machinery. Strip a log, add andesite alloy, done."
		""
		"Casings encase shafts and cogs to keep contraptions tidy and connectable."
		""
	]
	quest.209D0560ED3D4C5F.quest_subtitle: "Wrap it in wood"
	quest.20A3CD10861FE648.quest_desc: [
		"&aShafts&r and &aCogwheels&r carry rotation from one place to another. They are the veins of every contraption."
		""
		"Craft Shafts from Andesite Alloy, and Cogwheels from a Shaft and planks."
		""
		"Two cogwheels of different sizes let you change the speed of rotation."
	]
	quest.20A3CD10861FE648.quest_subtitle: "Transmit rotational force"
	quest.20A3D7F340B0C863.quest_desc: [
		"A &aWater Wheel&r spins when flowing water pushes its blades. It is the simplest reliable source of rotation."
		""
		"Place it in a stream, hook a shaft to the center, and you have free power. Upgrade to a &aLarge Water Wheel&r for more."
		""
	]
	quest.20A3D7F340B0C863.quest_subtitle: "Your first power source"
	quest.20A4F79E5ACF677F.quest_desc: [
		"&aCreate Nuclear&r runs on &aSteel&r. Superheat iron with coal dust in a mixer to cast &aSteel Ingots&r."
		""
		"Steel is the structural metal of reactors and heavy machines."
		""
		"&eThis milestone opens the Beyond the Machine branch.&r"
	]
	quest.20A4F79E5ACF677F.quest_subtitle: "Forge the endgame metal"
	quest.20A91FB0F8BB462F.quest_desc: [
		"The &aMillstone&r grinds ores, seeds and more using rotation. It is your first processing machine and needs only andesite."
		""
		"Feed it from above or by hand. Later, &aCrushing Wheels&r do the same job faster and double your ore."
		""
	]
	quest.20A91FB0F8BB462F.quest_subtitle: "Grind and crush"
	quest.20AACBD489D285A7.quest_desc: ["Adds Special Defense EVs, hardening a special wall."]
	quest.20B15066AC9B97D2.quest_desc: [
		"The &aDeployer&r uses items on the world just like a player: it plants, harvests, crafts in-world and applies tools."
		""
		"It needs a &aPrecision Mechanism&r. This is the first true automation block."
		""
		"&eThis milestone opens the Rotational Power branch.&r"
	]
	quest.20B15066AC9B97D2.quest_subtitle: "A mechanical hand"
	quest.20C2A022D887ED88.quest_desc: ["Cures paralysis on a single Pokemon."]
	quest.20C8F98628C8F832.quest_desc: [
		"A &aTrain Station&r assembles and dispatches trains and lets you schedule them. Add a &aConductor Whistle&r from Steam and Rails for hands-on control."
		""
		"Pair a station with bogeys and a controller to build your first working locomotive."
		""
	]
	quest.20C8F98628C8F832.quest_subtitle: "All aboard"
	quest.20CAAB71BA55C41D.quest_desc: [
		"Mix &aCopper&r and &aZinc&r in a heated basin to make &aBrass Ingots&r, then press them into &aBrass Casing&r."
		""
		"Brass unlocks the smarter half of Create: deployers, funnels, arms and more."
		""
	]
	quest.20CAAB71BA55C41D.quest_subtitle: "The second-tier metal"
	quest.20CBCF7B1EED391C.quest_desc: [
		"The &aMechanical Piston&r pushes and pulls entire structures as a moving contraption. Add &aLinear Chassis&r to hold blocks together."
		""
		"Doors, bridges, elevators and moving farms all start with this."
		""
	]
	quest.20CBCF7B1EED391C.quest_subtitle: "Move whole builds"
	quest.20D128D0BDB10CB3.quest_desc: [
		"Your machines now move items, process materials and build themselves. This is a full Create factory."
		""
		"&eClaim your reward and advance to Sparks and Circuits&r, where rotation becomes electricity."
		""
	]
	quest.20D128D0BDB10CB3.quest_subtitle: "Master of Rotational Power"
	quest.20D1FD9D0ADDE063.quest_desc: [
		"You have laid the foundation of Create: power sources, processing, brass and precision components."
		""
		"&eClaim your reward and move on to Rotational Power&r, where machines start working for you."
		""
	]
	quest.20D1FD9D0ADDE063.quest_subtitle: "Master of Cogs and Crates"
	quest.20D321EEC05603E1.quest_desc: [
		"&aCreate: Additions&r bridges Create rotation and Forge Energy (FE). It all runs on &aWires&r and &aConnectors&r that move power between blocks."
		""
		"Craft &aCopper Wire&r and a &aConnector&r to start your first electrical grid."
		""
		"&eThis milestone opens the Sparks and Circuits branch.&r"
	]
	quest.20D321EEC05603E1.quest_subtitle: "Electricity enters Create"
	quest.20D3234CBD4EBB26.quest_desc: [
		"Some Pokemon only evolve when traded, sometimes while holding an item. On a server you can set this up with a friend, or use a &aLink Cable&r to force a trade evolution on your own."
		""
		"Held items like the &aMetal Coat&r, &aKing's Rock&r, &aDragon Scale&r and &aUpgrade&r trigger specific trade evolutions."
		""
		"Obtain a Link Cable and a trade evolution item to unlock these Pokemon."
	]
	quest.20D3234CBD4EBB26.quest_subtitle: "Evolutions that need a trade"
	quest.20D998170F74A935.quest_desc: [
		"The &aMechanical Bearing&r rotates an attached contraption. Windmills, rotating displays and rolling machines are built on it."
		""
		"Pair it with a chassis to spin large builds around a single axis."
		""
	]
	quest.20D998170F74A935.quest_subtitle: "Spin anything"
	quest.20DF52C01D4B1B82.quest_desc: [
		"&aCentral Kitchen&r links Create automation to Farmer Delight cooking, letting deployers and mechanical crafters prepare food in bulk."
		""
		"Craft a &aMechanical Crafter&r to start building automated cooking lines."
		""
	]
	quest.20DF52C01D4B1B82.quest_subtitle: "Cook at scale"
	quest.20E148ACB00080FA.quest_desc: [
		"&aAnti-Radiation&r armor protects you from the radiation reactors and raw uranium give off."
		""
		"Craft at least a chestplate before you handle serious quantities of fuel."
		""
	]
	quest.20E148ACB00080FA.quest_subtitle: "Do not glow in the dark"
	quest.20E3EF17EDC036C8.quest_desc: [
		"The &aMechanical Arm&r picks items from inputs and drops them into outputs you assign. Perfect for feeding multiple machines from one belt."
		""
		"It needs a Precision Mechanism and a Brass Casing. Automation gets smart here."
		""
	]
	quest.20E3EF17EDC036C8.quest_subtitle: "Sort and distribute"
	quest.20E7C0647EB21B28.quest_desc: [
		"&aShafts&r carry rotational force in a straight line. &aCogwheels&r transfer it between parallel axes and change speed."
		""
		"Place a large cogwheel next to a small one to speed up, reverse it to gain torque."
		""
	]
	quest.20E7C0647EB21B28.quest_subtitle: "Move the power around"
	quest.20E7F625CC2F6BF3.quest_desc: [
		"Nuclear power, flight and dragon-forged gear. You have reached the summit of Create in Steamon."
		""
		"&eClaim the ultimate reward. There is nothing left to build that you cannot.&r"
		""
	]
	quest.20E7F625CC2F6BF3.quest_subtitle: "Beyond the Machine"
	quest.20EE532E0003B22D.quest_desc: [
		"The &aNetherite Jetpack&r is the top-tier flight chestplate: longer flight, more fuel efficiency and blast resistance."
		""
		"Combine a jetpack with an &aExoskeleton&r for the full endgame loadout."
		""
	]
	quest.20EE532E0003B22D.quest_subtitle: "The best set of wings"
	quest.20FB4CD6EA08FFD3.quest_desc: [
		"&aIntegrated Farming&r adds &aRoosts&r that raise chickens and other birds automatically, plus &aFishing Nets&r that fish while you work."
		""
		"Feed a roost and let it produce eggs, meat and feathers hands-free."
		""
	]
	quest.20FB4CD6EA08FFD3.quest_subtitle: "Automate the farmyard"
	quest.20FC1F519A9040EF.quest_desc: [
		"You generate, store and transmit power, and you automate enchanting. Create is now a fully electrified factory."
		""
		"&eClaim your reward and prepare for Beyond the Machine&r, the endgame of Steamon tech tree."
		""
	]
	quest.20FC1F519A9040EF.quest_subtitle: "Master of Sparks and Circuits"
	quest.20FE34F6B18DB45D.quest_desc: [
		"A &aChunk Loader&r forces its chunk to stay active even when no player is nearby, so remote farms and transmitters never pause."
		""
		"Essential for any automation you leave running while you are away."
		""
	]
	quest.20FE34F6B18DB45D.quest_subtitle: "Keep it loaded"
	quest.21121601C2CB9B7E.quest_desc: ["Halves Speed but adds Speed EVs after battle. A breeding and EV-training tool."]
	quest.212D7476B4076095.quest_desc: ["A famously bitter food berry with a strong smell. Culinary only, an acquired taste in recipes."]
	quest.213218C1D22EA2F2.quest_desc: [
		"A &aMechanical Crafter&r array crafts recipes automatically. Arrange crafters in the shape of the recipe, feed each slot, and power them."
		""
		"This is how you mass-produce complex items without ever opening a crafting table."
		""
		"Build a crafter array and connect its outputs with the wrench."
	]
	quest.213218C1D22EA2F2.quest_subtitle: "Craft in an automated grid"
	quest.214899BF912F4F74.quest_desc: ["Swaps a Pokemon between its two regular Abilities."]
	quest.21B58E36233A376E.quest_desc: ["A spicy-sweet food berry. No held effect, but a staple ingredient for cooking and treats."]
	quest.22256AB2CA6F8387.quest_desc: ["Adds Defense EVs to build a physical wall."]
	quest.22DA14024D89D66A.quest_desc: [
		"Your factory runs, but it is crude. This chapter is about &acontrol&r: dialing in exact speeds, chaining machines together, and crafting the most complex items in Create."
		""
		"You will also lay your first &atrain track&r and send a locomotive down it."
		""
		"Grab your goggles. Speed matters from here on."
	]
	quest.22DA14024D89D66A.quest_subtitle: "Precision and control"
	quest.22EBCEFF7199FB36.quest_desc: ["A Utility+ obsidian Attack cap."]
	quest.23417F87E6CFA339.quest_desc: ["Halves one super-effective Dragon-type hit. Essential tech on Dragon types in the mirror match."]
	quest.23D8DE84CD09720C.quest_desc: [
		"Every base runs on &aIron&r. Mine and smelt it for tools, machines and Poke Ball crafting."
		""
		"Collect a solid stock of Iron Ingots."
		""
		"Create and Cobblemon both eat iron by the stack."
	]
	quest.23D8DE84CD09720C.quest_subtitle: "Dig for the essentials"
	quest.2451ED951A75B7AD.quest_desc: [
		"You have mined the isles, cleared the dungeons and tamed the divine."
		""
		"Earn the &aGold Dungeon Key&r to conquer the Aether's final trial, the Sun Spirit."
		""
		"Few trainers ever rule the sky."
	]
	quest.2451ED951A75B7AD.quest_subtitle: "Champion of the heavens"
	quest.249ECDA7E5BA1D9E.quest_desc: [
		"The Nether's shadows hide Dark type Pokemon. Catch &a2 Dark type Pokemon&r here."
		""
		"Dark types punish the reckless and thrive far from the sun."
		""
		"A balanced Nether team runs fire and dark side by side."
	]
	quest.249ECDA7E5BA1D9E.quest_subtitle: "Creatures of the dark"
	quest.24A196A2176196BB.quest_desc: ["A round stone that evolves Happiny into Chansey when held during the day."]
	quest.24BD917FDE507BEF.quest_desc: ["Changes a Pokemon's nature to Careful, reshaping its stat spread without re-breeding."]
	quest.24DCCC0F39A3DB29.quest_desc: [
		"You have built it all: superheated steam power, self-driving trains, a package-logistics factory, jetpacks and a nuclear reactor."
		""
		"There is nothing left in Create you cannot automate. Assemble a &aReactor Output&r feeding a &aSteam Engine&r backup grid, or simply stand atop your factory and look at what you have made."
		""
		"Craft one final &aReactor Output&r to claim the title of &aMaster Engineer&r. The world of Steamon runs on your machines now."
	]
	quest.24DCCC0F39A3DB29.quest_subtitle: "Master Engineer of Steamon"
	quest.24EDE1EB4FBADB4C.quest_desc: ["Halves one super-effective Ground-type hit. A common pick on Fire, Electric and Steel types weak to Earthquake."]
	quest.2506D45CAAB9A0E9.quest_desc: ["Lets the holder survive any single hit at 1 HP from full. A frail sweeper staple."]
	quest.2514160C77268B55.quest_desc: ["A sour food berry, the sour member of the flavor-heal family. Chiefly a cooking ingredient here."]
	quest.25A62FB450AE4A72.quest_desc: [
		"You mastered the basics and built your first &aPrecision Mechanism&r. Now it is time to make Create do the work for you."
		""
		"This chapter is all about &amoving items automatically&r: belts, funnels, and the machines that act on the world without you."
		""
		"Keep a stack of &aBrass&r ready. You will need it."
	]
	quest.25A62FB450AE4A72.quest_subtitle: "Automation begins here"
	quest.25FF5F49346F0351.quest_desc: ["Raises Special Attack when HP runs low, powering up a special sweeper on its last legs."]
	quest.26207EC992C01174.quest_desc: [
		"You can only carry six Pokemon at a time. A &aPC&r lets you store all the rest safely."
		""
		"Craft and place a PC block, then access it to manage your boxes."
		""
		"A serious collector always keeps a PC nearby."
	]
	quest.26207EC992C01174.quest_subtitle: "Storage for a growing collection"
	quest.2644106AA53AF793.quest_desc: ["Changes a Pokemon's nature to Serious, reshaping its stat spread without re-breeding."]
	quest.268F06238367BCC1.quest_desc: [
		"Trains run on Create's own &aTrain Track&r, not vanilla rails. Craft track and use the &aTrack&r item to draw long curves and slopes."
		""
		"You need a &aRailway Casing&r to build station and bogey parts, so keep some ready."
		""
		"Lay a stretch of track. Your rail network starts here."
	]
	quest.268F06238367BCC1.quest_subtitle: "Lay down the rails"
	quest.26C0C6CE2C52BEB8.quest_desc: ["Restores a moderate amount of HP. The mid-tier heal."]
	quest.28506AD088DC6827.quest_desc: ["Lowers Defense EVs and raises friendship. Useful when reshaping a spread or pushing a friendship evolution."]
	quest.28C66D72E795C3F9.quest_desc: ["Triggers trade evolutions in Cobblemon without a partner. Evolves Machoke, Haunter and more."]
	quest.292433F584B1F7F8.quest_desc: ["Changes a Pokemon's nature to Calm, reshaping its stat spread without re-breeding."]
	quest.2942D044BBBC30C6.quest_desc: [
		"A &aTrain Schedule&r tells a train where to go and what to do without a driver. Insert it into the train's Controls to send it on an automatic route."
		""
		"Set stops, waiting conditions and cargo transfers so your network runs unattended."
		""
		"Write a schedule and let a train run a loop between your stations on its own."
	]
	quest.2942D044BBBC30C6.quest_subtitle: "Trains that drive themselves"
	quest.29753B0D399860BB.quest_desc: [
		"You can now control speed to the exact rotation, assemble complex items automatically, and run trains between stations."
		""
		"Bring together everything you learned: build an &aItem Vault&r fed by a &aMechanical Crafter&r line, and a &atrain&r that hauls the goods between two stations."
		""
		"Craft an &aElectron Tube&r worth of components, or simply gather &a8 more Precision Mechanisms&r, and step into the endgame."
	]
	quest.29753B0D399860BB.quest_subtitle: "Master of precision"
	quest.2A27EACB10DB3932.quest_desc: ["Adds Defense EVs to a Pokemon. Train up a physical wall fast."]
	quest.2AA86FA3605C966D.quest_desc: ["A hairy, sour food berry. No battle use, but a solid cooking ingredient."]
	quest.2BE068E77B254EBC.quest_desc: ["A fluffy cream that evolves Swirlix into Slurpuff on trade."]
	quest.2C8F8890D682892A.quest_desc: ["Halves Speed but adds Attack EVs after battle."]
	quest.2D0DD5D06EE5C01E.quest_desc: ["Adds a single Defense EV to round off bulk."]
	quest.2D2959F7A73FA0EB.quest_desc: ["Raises Defense when HP runs low, letting a wall dig in at the worst moment."]
	quest.2D4073C4E9B49592.quest_desc: [
		"Competitive Pokemon live and die by their &aheld item&r. Two items form the backbone of nearly every team."
		""
		"&aLeftovers&r slowly heals the holder every turn, keeping walls alive. The &aLife Orb&r boosts every attack at the cost of a little recoil."
		""
		"Obtain Leftovers and a Life Orb to arm your first competitive Pokemon."
	]
	quest.2D4073C4E9B49592.quest_subtitle: "The staple held items"
	quest.2D5627C699DEE86D.quest_desc: ["Thaws a frozen Pokemon."]
	quest.2D5D8F8ED4B33668.quest_desc: [
		"Deep in an End Ship hangs the &aElytra&r, the wings that let you glide across the world."
		""
		"Claim an Elytra from an End Ship."
		""
		"Pair it with fireworks and the whole map opens up."
	]
	quest.2D5D8F8ED4B33668.quest_subtitle: "Wings at last"
	quest.2D61BC168DEC8637.quest_desc: ["Changes a Pokemon's nature to Adamant, reshaping its stat spread without re-breeding."]
	quest.2D9165DC900E5B80.quest_desc: [
		"A &aTrain Station&r is where you assemble, name and dispatch trains. Place it beside a track to define a stop."
		""
		"From the station you can build a new train, board it, and send it on its way."
		""
		"Every rail line needs at least two stations to be useful."
	]
	quest.2D9165DC900E5B80.quest_subtitle: "Where trains stop"
	quest.2DBEA8B7F1AF1D5D.quest_desc: ["An electric device that evolves Electabuzz into Electivire."]
	quest.2DE76DFC1086F69F.quest_desc: ["Lets the holder move first within its priority bracket once when HP runs low. A clutch pinch berry for landing the final blow."]
	quest.2E1887D3388210DD.quest_desc: ["Boosts Special Defense by 50 percent but blocks status moves. Turns attackers into tanks."]
	quest.2E4B37499D05A742.quest_desc: [
		"Collect every Cobblemon berry to prove you are a true Berry Master."
		""
		"Reward: a random pull from the Berry Master table plus a big XP payout. The grand prize for filling every plot on the farm."
	]
	quest.2E4B37499D05A742.quest_subtitle: "Collect all 70 berries"
	quest.2E4B37499D05A742.title: "Berry Master"
	quest.2E77D644E3015866.quest_desc: ["Held glasses that boost the power of special moves by 10 percent."]
	quest.2E7F2F734F9ABE0B.quest_desc: ["Evolves Grass Pokemon like Gloom and Exeggcute."]
	quest.2F54C47EA3E0B697.quest_desc: [
		"Different Apricorns craft different balls. &aUltra Balls&r give you the best catch rate before the Master Ball."
		""
		"Craft a set of specialty balls to prepare for tougher catches. Great Balls and Ultra Balls will save many battles."
		""
		"Bring a good ball to a hard fight."
	]
	quest.2F54C47EA3E0B697.quest_subtitle: "A ball for every situation"
	quest.2FE46CF354474F9A.quest_desc: [
		"Prove you have mastered the shadow realm. Catch &a4 Pokemon&r total in the Otherside."
		""
		"Ghost, Dark and Dragon types await the bold."
		""
		"Few trainers ever assemble an Otherside team."
	]
	quest.2FE46CF354474F9A.quest_subtitle: "Walker of the Otherside"
	quest.3009BF63BDA7534E.quest_desc: [
		"&aRaid Den Crystals&r summon powerful boss Pokemon. Bring a &aCatching Charm&r to raise the catch rate and &aCheers&r to buff your party."
		""
		"Obtain a Catching Charm and clear the way to raid."
	]
	quest.3009BF63BDA7534E.quest_subtitle: "Team up on a boss"
	quest.3009BF63BDA7534E.title: "Raid Dens"
	quest.300F18E5A7C1E9C1.quest_desc: [
		"Some species wear a &aregional form&r, an Alolan, Galarian, Hisuian or Paldean variant with different types and looks."
		""
		"Catch a Pokemon of the &aAlola&r region to record a regional form."
	]
	quest.300F18E5A7C1E9C1.quest_subtitle: "Same name, new shape"
	quest.300F18E5A7C1E9C1.title: "Regional Forms"
	quest.3011D0116C97D3B8.quest_desc: [
		"Battle a wild Pokemon to lower its health, then throw a Poke Ball. The weaker and rarer the target, the harder the catch."
		""
		"Catch your first wild &aPokemon&r to grow your team beyond your starter."
	]
	quest.3011D0116C97D3B8.quest_subtitle: "Weaken it, then throw"
	quest.3011D0116C97D3B8.title: "First Catch"
	quest.301EBF84866B3D56.quest_desc: [
		"Poke Balls are crafted in Steamon from &aApricorns&r grown on trees. Cook and press them into the balls that catch wild Pokemon."
		""
		"Gather a starting stock of &aPoke Balls&r so you are never caught empty handed."
	]
	quest.301EBF84866B3D56.quest_subtitle: "No Trainer travels without Poke Balls"
	quest.301EBF84866B3D56.title: "Apricorn Balls"
	quest.302DD22E9EACED58.quest_desc: [
		"The Utility+ &aShiny Card&r raises your shiny encounter rate as you fill it, rewarding sustained hunting."
		""
		"Obtain a Shiny Card and start stacking your odds."
	]
	quest.302DD22E9EACED58.quest_subtitle: "Tilt the odds"
	quest.302DD22E9EACED58.title: "Shiny Charm"
	quest.3030E5100B772F76.quest_desc: [
		"Level 100 is the ceiling. Battle high level trainers, use Exp. Candies and spread experience to close the final levels."
		""
		"Raise any Pokemon to &alevel 100&r."
	]
	quest.3030E5100B772F76.quest_subtitle: "Push to 100"
	quest.3030E5100B772F76.title: "Maximum Level"
	quest.3036D09558224631.quest_desc: [
		"&aVitamins&r each add effort values to one stat, up to the cap. Combined with battling the right Pokemon, they shape a competitive spread."
		""
		"Gather one of each core vitamin to master EV training."
	]
	quest.3036D09558224631.quest_subtitle: "Vitamins raise effort values"
	quest.3036D09558224631.title: "EV Training"
	quest.303908B6866F41F7.quest_desc: [
		"A parent holding a &aDestiny Knot&r passes five of its IVs to the offspring instead of the usual three, the key to breeding perfect stats."
		""
		"Obtain a Destiny Knot for your breeding pen."
	]
	quest.303908B6866F41F7.quest_subtitle: "Pass down five IVs"
	quest.303908B6866F41F7.title: "Destiny Knot"
	quest.303E068A7A7CAFDB.quest_desc: [
		"A &aMega Bracelet&r (or Key Stone gear) lets a Pokemon holding its Mega Stone temporarily &aMega Evolve&r in battle for a huge power spike."
		""
		"Obtain the wearable trigger and a first Mega Stone to begin Mega Evolving."
	]
	quest.303E068A7A7CAFDB.quest_subtitle: "Unlock the surge"
	quest.303E068A7A7CAFDB.title: "Mega Evolution"
	quest.30476E776CD6A508.quest_desc: [
		"Made a mistake with EVs? &aMochi&r lets you adjust a Pokemon's training after the fact, raising the EVs of a chosen stat."
		""
		"Obtain a &aMochi&r and use it to fine tune a Pokemon that has already been trained."
		""
		"With Mochi you never have to start a Pokemon over from scratch."
	]
	quest.30476E776CD6A508.quest_subtitle: "Reset and retrain"
	quest.3047F188A089450E.quest_desc: [
		"&aDefeat 100 Pokemon&r in battle, wild encounters or the teams of rival Trainers, to prove your combat record."
		""
		"Rack up 100 victories."
	]
	quest.3047F188A089450E.quest_subtitle: "One hundred wins"
	quest.3047F188A089450E.title: "Battle Hardened"
	quest.3052CD5F4DA81C08.quest_desc: [
		"&aAprijuice&r brewed from Apricorns boosts a rideable Pokemon's speed, jump and stamina so it carries you across the world."
		""
		"Brew a Swift Aprijuice and take to the road on your partner."
	]
	quest.3052CD5F4DA81C08.quest_subtitle: "Journey Mounts"
	quest.3052CD5F4DA81C08.title: "Ride On"
	quest.305663B330131573.quest_desc: [
		"Two compatible Pokemon left together produce an &aEgg&r. Hold a &aDestiny Knot&r to pass down more IVs, an &aEverstone&r to lock a nature."
		""
		"Hatch an Egg to prove you understand breeding."
	]
	quest.305663B330131573.quest_subtitle: "Eggs and inheritance"
	quest.305663B330131573.title: "The Breeder"
	quest.30719A910D67E638.quest_desc: [
		"A parent holding an &aEverstone&r passes its exact nature to every offspring, and stops that Pokemon from evolving."
		""
		"Obtain an Everstone to control inherited natures."
	]
	quest.30719A910D67E638.quest_subtitle: "Lock the nature"
	quest.30719A910D67E638.title: "Everstone"
	quest.3084470212E5AD9E.quest_desc: ["A heavy protective item that evolves Rhydon into Rhyperior on trade."]
	quest.3090960AFB219897.quest_desc: [
		"You breed for stats, train EVs, wield Mega Stones, ride mounts and raid dens. Few Trainers reach this far."
		""
		"&eUnlocks Myths \& Legends&r once the Ender Dragon falls. Claim the Trainer's Path cache."
		""
		"Reward: one pull from the Trainer's Path loot table, plus a bonus."
	]
	quest.3090960AFB219897.quest_subtitle: "A battler and a collector"
	quest.3090960AFB219897.title: "Trainer's Path Complete"
	quest.30A01E1B7FF3061E.quest_desc: [
		"A &aHealing Machine&r fully restores your whole party's health and status in seconds, powered by redstone."
		""
		"Craft one and you never have to trek home to heal again."
	]
	quest.30A01E1B7FF3061E.quest_subtitle: "Restore your team"
	quest.30A01E1B7FF3061E.title: "Field Medic"
	quest.30A36CD67E88494F.quest_desc: [
		"Shinies, regional forms, a maxed team, a wide Pokedex and a hundred wins. You stand among the legends."
		""
		"Claim the ultimate cache. There is no higher Trainer rank in Steamon."
		""
		"Reward: one pull from the Myths \& Legends loot table, plus a bonus."
	]
	quest.30A36CD67E88494F.quest_subtitle: "The peak of the journey"
	quest.30A36CD67E88494F.title: "Champion of Steamon"
	quest.30A94C8C925E9C8A.quest_desc: [
		"The &aPC&r lets you store, sort and swap Pokemon beyond your six party slots. Every catch is safely kept here."
		""
		"Build a PC to manage a growing collection."
	]
	quest.30A94C8C925E9C8A.quest_subtitle: "More than six"
	quest.30A94C8C925E9C8A.title: "Storage System"
	quest.30AFAC41F3B73B72.quest_desc: [
		"You have your first partner, a full ball line, vitamins and evolution stones. The basics are yours."
		""
		"&eUnlocks the Trainer's Path&r. Claim a random reward from the First Steps cache."
		""
		"Reward: one pull from the First Steps loot table, plus a bonus."
	]
	quest.30AFAC41F3B73B72.quest_subtitle: "You are a Trainer now"
	quest.30AFAC41F3B73B72.title: "First Steps Complete"
	quest.30D36D71F92789E4.quest_desc: [
		"Serious shiny hunters do not rely on luck alone. The &aShiny Card&r from the Utility+ toolkit boosts your chance of finding a shiny."
		""
		"Combine it with chained encounters and a full breeding setup to hunt efficiently."
		""
		"Obtain a Shiny Card and turn shiny hunting from a dream into a plan."
	]
	quest.30D36D71F92789E4.quest_subtitle: "Tip the odds in your favour"
	quest.30D545F671BDE23C.quest_desc: [
		"&aUtility+ Caps&r let you tune a Pokemon's hidden IVs. The &aWooden Cap&r is the entry tier, a taste of the stat control to come."
		""
		"Obtain a Wooden Cap and a Common Candy to learn the Utility+ tools."
	]
	quest.30D545F671BDE23C.quest_subtitle: "Utility+ starter gear"
	quest.30D545F671BDE23C.title: "A Trainer's Cap"
	quest.30DF64A78E3B293A.quest_desc: [
		"&aRare Candy&r raises a Pokemon one level instantly. &aExp. Candies&r grant a fixed chunk of experience, from XS up to XL."
		""
		"Stock candies to speed weaker team members up to fighting shape."
	]
	quest.30DF64A78E3B293A.quest_subtitle: "Levels in a wrapper"
	quest.30DF64A78E3B293A.title: "Sweet Shortcut"
	quest.30E0E43F6CBBE3F0.quest_desc: [
		"&aShiny Pokemon&r wear alternate colours and appear once in several thousand encounters. Catching one is the mark of a dedicated Trainer."
		""
		"Hunt down and catch a single shiny Pokemon to open the endgame."
	]
	quest.30E0E43F6CBBE3F0.quest_subtitle: "One in thousands"
	quest.30E0E43F6CBBE3F0.title: "Shiny Hunter"
	quest.30E8147CBFAFB5F1.quest_desc: [
		"A living record of every Pokemon you meet is the badge of a serious Trainer. Push your &aPokedex&r wide."
		""
		"Catch &a50 Pokemon&r in total."
	]
	quest.30E8147CBFAFB5F1.quest_subtitle: "Fifty species"
	quest.30E8147CBFAFB5F1.title: "Pokedex Drive"
	quest.30E9681CB438878A.quest_desc: [
		"Every Trainer's journey opens with a single choice. Use a &aCobblemon starter block&r or interact with a wild Pokemon to bind your first partner."
		""
		"Your starter follows you, battles at your side, and levels up as you fight. Treat it well."
	]
	quest.30E9681CB438878A.quest_subtitle: "Choose a starter and begin"
	quest.30E9681CB438878A.title: "Your First Partner"
	quest.30FF79947BBD7BF0.quest_desc: [
		"A &aLab Table&r and a &aChisel&r let you clean fossils from &aConcretion&r and resurrect long extinct Pokemon."
		""
		"Set up a Lab Table and a chisel to start reviving fossils."
	]
	quest.30FF79947BBD7BF0.quest_subtitle: "Revive the ancients"
	quest.30FF79947BBD7BF0.title: "Paleontologist"
	quest.31012EE829FC79F0.quest_desc: ["A shiny Utility+ Special Attack cap variant."]
	quest.3156ED3D702729A3.quest_desc: ["Halves one super-effective Rock-type hit. Great on Fire, Flying, Bug and Ice types that dread Stone Edge."]
	quest.31852E57381A525C.quest_desc: ["A basic Utility+ wooden cap, the entry-level IV cap."]
	quest.31A8811F6306EC1C.quest_desc: ["Raises accuracy for the next move when HP runs low, guaranteeing an otherwise shaky attack lands."]
	quest.31BD3E00B19E4485.quest_desc: ["A crisp white Apricorn juice."]
	quest.31D5CA11EE99E264.quest_desc: [
		"Within the Ancient City stands a &aportal frame&r of Otherside stone. Fill it to open the gate."
		""
		"Build and activate the Otherside portal, then step through."
		""
		"The Otherside is a dark mirror of the Deep Dark."
	]
	quest.31D5CA11EE99E264.quest_subtitle: "Open the Otherside portal"
	quest.31E6BFCD89999B31.quest_desc: ["Cures poison on a single Pokemon."]
	quest.325E291E2A1ACC80.quest_desc: ["Adds a single HP EV. Fine-tune a spread to the exact point."]
	quest.32617E6A0918F050.quest_desc: [
		"A belt is useless if nothing loads it. &aFunnels&r insert and extract items between belts, chests and machines."
		""
		"Craft &aAndesite Funnels&r and use them to feed a belt from a chest, and to pull finished goods off the other end."
		""
		"Sneak-right-click a funnel with the wrench to flip its direction."
	]
	quest.32617E6A0918F050.quest_subtitle: "Put items on and take them off"
	quest.338F6A3444EB747E.quest_desc: ["Thaws a frozen Pokemon at once so it can act instead of waiting out the freeze."]
	quest.33DFC5D1B2C45880.quest_desc: ["Halves one super-effective Flying-type hit. Shields Grass, Fighting and Bug types from Brave Bird."]
	quest.34B759513B49F5E7.quest_desc: [
		"The &aMechanical Saw&r chops trees, cuts logs into planks, and processes items travelling on a belt."
		""
		"Face it upward to fell a whole tree, or lay it under a belt to slice items as they pass."
		""
		"Pair it with a drill and a belt for your first fully automatic tree farm."
	]
	quest.34B759513B49F5E7.quest_subtitle: "Cut logs and slice materials"
	quest.3544A6C021D49696.quest_desc: [
		"Caught a great Pokemon with the wrong Nature? &aMints&r overwrite how a Nature affects stats without breeding a new one."
		""
		"Each mint favours a different stat spread. Grab an &aAdamant&r, &aModest&r, &aJolly&r or &aTimid&r mint to match your Pokemon's role."
		""
		"Obtain a Mint and correct a Nature the easy way."
	]
	quest.3544A6C021D49696.quest_subtitle: "Change a Pokemon's Nature"
	quest.3557D562DF4C7F99.quest_desc: ["Evolves gender-specific Pokemon like male Kirlia and female Snorunt."]
	quest.3566895E4C3B18C3.quest_desc: [
		"IVs are locked when a Pokemon is caught or bred, but in Steamon you can fix them afterwards. &aBottle Caps&r max out an IV to its highest value."
		""
		"A &aSilver Cap&r maxes one chosen stat, and a &aGolden Cap&r maxes every stat at once. The &aAbility Patch&r swaps a Pokemon to its Hidden Ability."
		""
		"Obtain a Bottle Cap and an Ability Patch to finish a truly competitive Pokemon."
	]
	quest.3566895E4C3B18C3.quest_subtitle: "Perfect the invisible stats"
	quest.35B939FA61281403.quest_desc: ["Evolves Sneasel into Weavile when held at night, and raises the critical-hit ratio."]
	quest.35E796275277CA87.quest_desc: ["Halves one super-effective Poison-type hit, protecting Grass and Fairy types."]
	quest.364B83B69AD9778A.quest_desc: [
		"You already have a &aPasture Block&r. Now put it to work. Leave a compatible male and female pair in the pasture and, over time, they will produce an &aEgg&r."
		""
		"Pick up the Egg, keep it in your party, and walk around until it &ahatches&r into a fresh baby Pokemon."
		""
		"Hatch your first Egg to begin your breeding operation."
	]
	quest.364B83B69AD9778A.quest_subtitle: "Where new Pokemon come from"
	quest.36ADA139846D7C06.quest_desc: [
		"The islands are built from &aHolystone&r. Mine it for the Aether's tools and building blocks."
		""
		"Collect a stack of Holystone."
		""
		"Holystone tools match iron and open the Aether tech tree."
	]
	quest.36ADA139846D7C06.quest_subtitle: "Stone of the heavens"
	quest.36CF5C05E74DB66B.quest_desc: [
		"The path to the &aOtherside&r begins in the &aDeep Dark&r, in an &aAncient City&r beneath the world."
		""
		"Find an Ancient City and loot its chests. Beware the Warden."
		""
		"Somewhere down there is the doorway to another realm."
	]
	quest.36CF5C05E74DB66B.quest_subtitle: "Descend to the Ancient City"
	quest.36E83CD82E8BCD6A.quest_desc: [
		"The Otherside crawls with &aGhost type Pokemon&r from the &aOthersideCobblemonSpawns&r pack. Catch &a2 Ghost types&r here."
		""
		"Ghost types haunt this dimension in numbers found nowhere else."
		""
		"Bring a light and a steady nerve."
	]
	quest.36E83CD82E8BCD6A.quest_subtitle: "Spirits of the dark"
	quest.374870F324D9E89A.quest_desc: ["Halves one super-effective Electric-type hit. Popular on Flying and Water types that fear Thunderbolt."]
	quest.38EF33E37694D858.quest_desc: ["A Utility+ obsidian Defense cap."]
	quest.39A88117C609668C.quest_desc: ["Adds Attack EVs to a Pokemon, up to the training cap. The staple physical EV booster."]
	quest.39F635149B364918.quest_desc: ["A Utility+ cap that guarantees a high Special Attack IV floor."]
	quest.3A21272C12F3782D.quest_desc: ["A fiery, spicy food berry covered in bumps. No battle effect; grow it for cooking."]
	quest.3AB4439C155914C0.quest_desc: ["Snaps a confused Pokemon back to its senses, preventing it from hurting itself."]
	quest.3AB6518666694897.quest_desc: [
		"Dark type Pokemon rule the Otherside alongside the ghosts. Catch &a2 Dark types&r here."
		""
		"Dark types thrive far from any sun."
		""
		"Fire and Ghost teammates cover their weaknesses well."
	]
	quest.3AB6518666694897.quest_subtitle: "Denizens of shadow"
	quest.3B6AB31341B3AAFC.quest_desc: ["A Utility+ obsidian Special Defense cap."]
	quest.3B969103F9DFB793.quest_desc: [
		"The End is home to powerful &aPsychic type Pokemon&r. Catch &a2 Psychic types&r here."
		""
		"Psychic types command the strange energies of this dimension."
		""
		"Weaken carefully, these are rare and strong."
	]
	quest.3B969103F9DFB793.quest_subtitle: "Minds beyond the void"
	quest.3BD366314373ABBA.quest_desc: [
		"The &aPasture Block&r lets your Pokemon roam free and, with a compatible pair, produce eggs."
		""
		"Craft and place a Pasture Block, then send out Pokemon to live in it."
		""
		"Breeding is the key to perfect teams and shiny hunting."
	]
	quest.3BD366314373ABBA.quest_subtitle: "Start your breeding operation"
	quest.3BDE170AFAF57E6B.quest_desc: ["Wakes a sleeping Pokemon."]
	quest.3D6F33D9671494ED.quest_desc: [
		"The &aMaster Ball&r catches any Pokemon without fail, no weakening required. There is nothing rarer or more valuable in a Trainer's bag."
		""
		"Earn or craft a single Master Ball and save it for the catch of a lifetime, a legendary or the perfect shiny."
		""
		"Obtain a Master Ball. You are now Trainer elite."
	]
	quest.3D6F33D9671494ED.quest_subtitle: "The ball that never fails"
	quest.3D879914D095ABB7.quest_desc: [
		"A &aChute&r moves items vertically and can drop them straight onto a belt or into a machine below."
		""
		"Craft a Chute and a &aDepot&r. The Depot holds a single stack in the world, perfect for hand-feeding or as a machine target."
		""
		"With belts, funnels, chutes and depots you can route items anywhere."
	]
	quest.3D879914D095ABB7.quest_subtitle: "Drop items neatly onto belts"
	quest.3E17125E0F3C140B.quest_desc: ["A Utility+ cap that guarantees a high Special Defense IV floor."]
	quest.3E174A401C17B850.quest_desc: [
		"&aNether Quartz&r is used across Create redstone builds and decorative recipes."
		""
		"Mine a good stock of Nether Quartz."
		""
		"The Nether is the only place it grows."
	]
	quest.3E174A401C17B850.quest_subtitle: "Harvest the wastes"
	quest.3E7681AB12026F3F.quest_desc: ["Lowers Speed EVs and raises friendship, useful for Trick Room builds or friendship evolutions."]
	quest.3F0B9882273FBF16.quest_desc: [
		"Collect every Cobblemon cooking, vitamin and medicine item to master the kitchen."
		""
		"Reward: a random pull from the Master Chef table plus a big XP payout."
	]
	quest.3F0B9882273FBF16.quest_subtitle: "Cook and collect it all"
	quest.3F0B9882273FBF16.title: "Master Chef"
	quest.3F6695E3C74A3BEF.quest_desc: [
		"Machines need a source of rotation. The &aWater Wheel&r is the easiest early generator: place it in flowing water and it spins forever."
		""
		"Alternatively, a &aWindmill Bearing&r with eight Sails gives even more power."
		""
		"Build a Water Wheel and get your first stress network running."
	]
	quest.3F6695E3C74A3BEF.quest_subtitle: "Free, endless rotational power"
	quest.3FED7EC956C69B35.quest_desc: ["A special Utility+ card tied to shiny Pokemon rewards."]
	quest.4000684EADA90E4E.quest_desc: [
		"&aDark type&r Pokemon rule the Otherside alongside the ghosts. Catch 2 here."
		""
		"Dark types thrive far from any sun. Fire and Ghost teammates cover their weaknesses well."
	]
	quest.4000684EADA90E4E.quest_subtitle: "Denizens of shadow"
	quest.4000684EADA90E4E.title: "Catch Dark-types"
	quest.400288EDEEB9E085.quest_desc: [
		"&aBastion Remnants&r are piglin strongholds packed with gold and gear."
		""
		"Loot a bastion and bring back its treasure. Wear your gold and watch the brutes."
		""
		"This is where the road to Netherite begins."
	]
	quest.400288EDEEB9E085.quest_subtitle: "Raid the bastion"
	quest.4006743C0D1865AD.quest_desc: [
		"Among the clouds live &aFairy type&r Pokemon of pure and radiant nature. Catch 2 here."
		""
		"Fairy types shine in the Aether's holy light. Gentle to look at, fierce in battle."
	]
	quest.4006743C0D1865AD.quest_subtitle: "Divine little spirits"
	quest.4006743C0D1865AD.title: "Catch Fairy-types"
	quest.4007E20DAC235BE9.quest_desc: [
		"&aEnder Pearls&r and &aBlaze Powder&r make &aEyes of Ender&r. Throw them to follow the trail to the stronghold portal."
		""
		"Craft 6 Eyes of Ender, then fill the End portal frame and step through."
		""
		"A barren island floats in the void. Upon it waits the Ender Dragon."
	]
	quest.4007E20DAC235BE9.quest_subtitle: "Find the stronghold"
	quest.40091CD67B4264AE.quest_desc: [
		"The &aAether&r portal is framed in &aGlowstone&r instead of obsidian. Build the frame, then pour a bucket of &awater&r inside to open it."
		""
		"Step through and rise into a paradise of floating islands, holy stone and divine creatures."
		""
		"&aFlying&r and &aFairy&r type Pokemon drift between the isles up here."
	]
	quest.40091CD67B4264AE.quest_subtitle: "A gateway of glowstone"
	quest.40091CD67B4264AE.title: "Enter the Aether"
	quest.400B70B15CA981EA.quest_desc: [
		"&aReinforced Echo Shards&r are the Otherside's crafting cores, forged from echo shards and the realm's own stone."
		""
		"Craft a Reinforced Echo Shard. It fuels the strongest Deeper Darker gear."
	]
	quest.400B70B15CA981EA.quest_subtitle: "Shards of the deep"
	quest.400B70B15CA981EA.title: "Reinforced Echo Shard"
	quest.4017A30D1D6290F2.title: "Paradox Hunt"
	quest.401C56BC12A6160F.quest_desc: [
		"The &aBeast Ball&r is built for the oddest Pokemon. Stock up for the hardest hunts."
		""
		"Gather 3 Beast Balls, then save the reward for the Aether and Otherside legends."
	]
	quest.401C56BC12A6160F.quest_subtitle: "Balls for the strangest catches"
	quest.401CF50145120356.quest_desc: [
		"&aAncient Debris&r hides deep near the lava seas. Smelt it into scrap and forge &aNetherite Ingots&r."
		""
		"Process enough debris for one Netherite Ingot. Netherite gear survives what diamond cannot."
	]
	quest.401CF50145120356.quest_subtitle: "The hardest metal"
	quest.401CF9AF56F01343.quest_desc: [
		"The &aSilver Dungeon&r floats in the clouds, home to the Valkyries and their Queen."
		""
		"Defeat the Valkyrie Queen. Only a proven trainer survives her blades."
	]
	quest.401CF9AF56F01343.quest_subtitle: "The Silver Dungeon"
	quest.401CF9AF56F01343.title: "The Silver Dungeon"
	quest.4029EBE8C49167AB.quest_desc: [
		"You have opened the gate, cleared the temple and tamed the dark."
		""
		"Forge a piece of &aResonarium&r armor to seal your mastery of every dimension, then claim a random pull from the &aOtherside Cache&r."
		""
		"From the overworld to the Otherside, Steamon holds no realm you have not conquered."
	]
	quest.4029EBE8C49167AB.quest_subtitle: "Sovereign of the shadow realm"
	quest.402B24236BC528BD.quest_desc: [
		"&aNether Wart&r is the base of every potion, grown in fortress soul sand gardens."
		""
		"Collect 8 Nether Wart and start a brewing supply. Potions keep you and your team in the fight."
	]
	quest.402B24236BC528BD.quest_subtitle: "Brew and grow"
	quest.403420D65C5F13B8.title: "Shadow Host"
	quest.403463CB69668C51.quest_desc: [
		"&aNether Fortresses&r are the home of blazes and the only source of &aBlaze Rods&r."
		""
		"Defeat blazes and claim 3 Blaze Rods. They power brewing and heat your Create foundry."
	]
	quest.403463CB69668C51.quest_subtitle: "Storm the fortress"
	quest.403EA98C0D6DA092.quest_desc: [
		"The End is home to powerful &aPsychic type&r Pokemon. Catch 2 of them here."
		""
		"Psychic types command the strange energies of this dimension. Weaken them carefully, they are rare and strong."
	]
	quest.403EA98C0D6DA092.quest_subtitle: "Minds beyond the void"
	quest.403EA98C0D6DA092.title: "Catch Psychic-types"
	quest.4040629EF17E4552.quest_desc: [
		"Deep in an &aEnd Ship&r hangs the &aElytra&r, the wings that let you glide across the world."
		""
		"Claim one Elytra. Pair it with fireworks and the whole map opens up."
	]
	quest.4040629EF17E4552.quest_subtitle: "Wings at last"
	quest.4043768E77603466.quest_desc: [
		"Deep in the Otherside stands a &aTemple&r holding the &aHeart of the Deep&r, its greatest treasure."
		""
		"Explore the temple and claim the Heart of the Deep. It is the key to the realm's finest crafts."
	]
	quest.4043768E77603466.quest_subtitle: "The Otherside Temple"
	quest.4044E086A32B8BAB.title: "Psychic Legion"
	quest.4045C5FE831B4402.quest_desc: [
		"The Aether teems with &aFlying type&r Pokemon drifting between islands. Catch 2 of them."
		""
		"Flying types rule these open skies. Watch your footing, the drop is a long one."
	]
	quest.4045C5FE831B4402.quest_subtitle: "Wings among the clouds"
	quest.4045C5FE831B4402.title: "Catch Flying-types"
	quest.405357394611F7F4.quest_desc: [
		"Ride the outer gateway to the &aEnd Cities&r, towers full of loot and shulkers."
		""
		"Bring back 2 &aShulker Shells&r. Shulker boxes are the best portable storage in the game."
	]
	quest.405357394611F7F4.quest_subtitle: "Plunder the End Cities"
	quest.4053CC3CE24C8C96.quest_desc: [
		"You have slain the dragon, looted the cities and earned your wings."
		""
		"Assemble a true End team by catching &a4 Pokemon&r in the void, then claim a random pull from the &aEnd Cache&r."
		""
		"The sky is not the limit. The Aether calls those who conquer the End."
	]
	quest.4053CC3CE24C8C96.quest_subtitle: "Champion of the End"
	quest.4053CC3CE24C8C96.title: "End Master"
	quest.405B885C41DDE9FE.quest_desc: [
		"&aNether Quartz&r feeds Create redstone builds and dozens of decorative recipes."
		""
		"Mine 16 Nether Quartz. The Nether is the only place it grows."
	]
	quest.405B885C41DDE9FE.quest_subtitle: "Harvest the wastes"
	quest.405F38BF62A148A7.title: "Skybound Flock"
	quest.4064C3F139A34C8D.title: "Dragon Legion"
	quest.4066741F39AE17E5.quest_desc: [
		"The Otherside is carved from &aGloomslate&r and &aSculk Stone&r. Mine it to build in this shadowed world."
		""
		"Collect a stack of Cobbled Gloomslate. Its tools and armor rival the overworld's best."
	]
	quest.4066741F39AE17E5.quest_subtitle: "Stone of the other realm"
	quest.407DE90E67F64A06.quest_desc: [
		"The Nether's shadows hide &aDark type&r Pokemon. Catch 2 of them here."
		""
		"Dark types punish the reckless and thrive far from the sun. A balanced Nether team runs fire and dark side by side."
	]
	quest.407DE90E67F64A06.quest_subtitle: "Creatures of the dark"
	quest.407DE90E67F64A06.title: "Catch Dark-types"
	quest.408268A0E9C639C1.quest_desc: [
		"Build a squad suited to the heat. Catch &a3 Fire type&r Pokemon down here."
		""
		"Fire types resist the environment and hit hard. Weaken them first, the Nether species are tough."
	]
	quest.408268A0E9C639C1.quest_subtitle: "A proper fire team"
	quest.408268A0E9C639C1.title: "Catch Fire-types"
	quest.40842F992469C8BC.quest_desc: [
		"&aZanite&r is the Aether's own gemstone. Its tools grow stronger as they wear down."
		""
		"Mine &aZanite Gemstones&r from inside the islands. A fine step up from Holystone gear."
	]
	quest.40842F992469C8BC.quest_subtitle: "Gems of the sky"
	quest.40842F992469C8BC.title: "Zanite Gear"
	quest.4089CCC850C250F5.quest_desc: [
		"Activate the End portal and drop into the &aEnd&r."
		""
		"Bring blocks to bridge, a bow, and courage. The dragon does not wait."
	]
	quest.4089CCC850C250F5.quest_subtitle: "Into the void"
	quest.4089CCC850C250F5.title: "Enter the End"
	quest.408EF2591FC945BB.quest_desc: [
		"You have looted the fortress, raided the bastion and forged the hardest metal in the game."
		""
		"Craft one more &aNetherite Ingot&r as your trophy, then claim a random pull from the &aNether Cache&r."
		""
		"With the Nether behind you, the End awaits."
	]
	quest.408EF2591FC945BB.quest_subtitle: "Master of the fire realm"
	quest.40996153FB959512.quest_desc: [
		"Build a &aNether Portal&r from obsidian and light it. Step through into a world of fire, ash and rare Pokemon."
		""
		"Bring &agold&r armor or trinkets. The piglins respect those who wear it, and the road ahead runs hot."
		""
		"Fire and Dark type Pokemon spawn here and almost nowhere else."
	]
	quest.40996153FB959512.quest_subtitle: "Light the way down"
	quest.40996153FB959512.title: "Into the Nether"
	quest.409E53EBB16ED918.quest_desc: [
		"The &aEnder Dragon&r rules the central island. Destroy the End Crystals, then bring it down."
		""
		"Defeating it opens the gateway to the outer End islands. This is the classic endgame boss, so come prepared."
	]
	quest.409E53EBB16ED918.quest_subtitle: "Slay the Ender Dragon"
	quest.409E53EBB16ED918.title: "Slay the Ender Dragon"
	quest.40A3460330537B45.quest_desc: [
		"&aGravitite&r is the rarest Aether ore, floating upward when disturbed. Its tools levitate blocks."
		""
		"Mine one &aGravitite Ore&r, the pinnacle of Aether mining."
	]
	quest.40A3460330537B45.quest_subtitle: "Defy gravity"
	quest.40A6732E54F42423.title: "Frozen Isles"
	quest.40A7467B5D2CE20D.quest_desc: [
		"Within the Ancient City stands a portal frame of &aOtherside stone&r. Fill and light it to open the gate, then step through."
		""
		"The Otherside is a dark mirror of the Deep Dark, sprawling and silent."
	]
	quest.40A7467B5D2CE20D.quest_subtitle: "Open the Otherside portal"
	quest.40A7467B5D2CE20D.title: "Enter the Otherside"
	quest.40AACB4577F3D5EB.quest_desc: [
		"The &aBronze Dungeon&r is guarded by the Slider. Beat it to earn its loot and a &aBronze Dungeon Key&r."
		""
		"Defeat the Slider. The dungeons hold the Aether's finest treasures."
	]
	quest.40AACB4577F3D5EB.quest_subtitle: "The Bronze Dungeon"
	quest.40AACB4577F3D5EB.title: "The Bronze Dungeon"
	quest.40B0202CA677F4CD.quest_desc: [
		"The Otherside hides rare &aDragon&r and paradox Pokemon in its deepest reaches."
		""
		"Catch a Dragon type here. A Beast Ball may be your best chance at the strangest species."
	]
	quest.40B0202CA677F4CD.quest_subtitle: "Dragons in the deep"
	quest.40B0202CA677F4CD.title: "Catch Dragon-types"
	quest.40C4EA2C73849FF0.quest_desc: [
		"The path to the &aOtherside&r begins in the &aDeep Dark&r, inside an &aAncient City&r beneath the world."
		""
		"Sneak past the Warden, loot the chests and bring back 2 &aEcho Shards&r. Somewhere down there is the doorway to another realm."
		""
		"&aGhost&r, &aDark&r and &aDragon&r type Pokemon lurk beyond the gate."
	]
	quest.40C4EA2C73849FF0.quest_subtitle: "Descend to the Ancient City"
	quest.40C8746684D36B5F.title: "Void Wanderers"
	quest.40CDEB41E5A18660.title: "Ghostly Host"
	quest.40CE4F3B89953E7A.title: "Blazing Squad"
	quest.40D4379A448269BF.quest_desc: [
		"The islands are built from &aHolystone&r. Mine it for the Aether's tools and building blocks."
		""
		"Collect a stack of Holystone. Its tools match iron and open the Aether tech tree."
	]
	quest.40D4379A448269BF.quest_subtitle: "Stone of the heavens"
	quest.40D62523710408DC.quest_desc: [
		"Where better to find &aDragon type&r Pokemon than the End? Catch one here."
		""
		"Dragon types are among the strongest partners in the game. A patient trainer earns a mighty ally."
	]
	quest.40D62523710408DC.quest_subtitle: "Tame a dragon of your own"
	quest.40D62523710408DC.title: "Catch Dragon-types"
	quest.40DEB2DB8508FE06.quest_desc: [
		"You have mined the isles, cleared the Bronze and Silver dungeons and tamed the divine."
		""
		"Enter the &aGold Dungeon&r and defeat the &aSun Spirit&r, the Aether's final trial, then claim a random pull from the &aAether Cache&r."
		""
		"Few trainers ever rule the sky."
	]
	quest.40DEB2DB8508FE06.quest_subtitle: "Champion of the heavens"
	quest.40DEB2DB8508FE06.title: "Aether Master"
	quest.40E836AE008BD782.quest_desc: [
		"The Otherside crawls with &aGhost type&r Pokemon from the OthersideCobblemonSpawns pack. Catch 2 of them here."
		""
		"Ghost types haunt this dimension in numbers found nowhere else. Bring a light and a steady nerve."
	]
	quest.40E836AE008BD782.quest_subtitle: "Spirits of the dark"
	quest.40E836AE008BD782.title: "Catch Ghost-types"
	quest.40EF3BD366314373.title: "Shadow Squad"
	quest.40F718D2A904C1D2.title: "Fairy Court"
	quest.40FF75F82B92A6B7.title: "Catch Ground-types"
	quest.41EFBDCF0556574A.quest_desc: ["Ignores entry hazards on switch-in. Essential tech against Stealth Rock teams."]
	quest.42B8ED6522652C2F.quest_desc: ["Adds Speed EVs, pushing a sweeper past the field."]
	quest.4384182E9FA93AC7.quest_desc: [
		"The &aMechanical Drill&r mines any block placed in front of it, and grinds items on a belt or depot below it."
		""
		"Power it with rotation and point it at a block to break it automatically."
		""
		"Drills are the heart of every automated quarry."
	]
	quest.4384182E9FA93AC7.quest_subtitle: "Break blocks without lifting a finger"
	quest.439125930B53268F.quest_desc: ["Changes a Pokemon's nature to Bold, reshaping its stat spread without re-breeding."]
	quest.43A9B8A977E70989.quest_desc: ["Cures the holder of move-blocking effects like Taunt or Encore, once."]
	quest.43BAF2421419EA72.quest_desc: [
		"&aZanite&r is the Aether's own gemstone, used for tools that grow stronger as they wear down."
		""
		"Mine &aZanite Gemstones&r from the islands."
		""
		"Zanite gear is a fine step up from Holystone."
	]
	quest.43BAF2421419EA72.quest_subtitle: "Gems of the sky"
	quest.43C55E1C1051E955.quest_desc: ["Held item that halves the damage from a super-effective Fire-type move once. A lifesaver for Grass, Ice, Bug and Steel types."]
	quest.445A32A5539F158B.quest_desc: [
		"Steamon runs a dedicated &aResource World&r that resets on a schedule, so you can mine freely without scarring the main map."
		""
		"Use the resource world command (for example &e/rw&r or the server menu) to travel to the exploration dimension and mine there."
		""
		"Bring back a stack of raw materials from the resource world."
	]
	quest.445A32A5539F158B.quest_subtitle: "Strip the land, spare your home"
	quest.44943D9F41393F60.quest_desc: ["Cures a burn, restoring lost Attack pressure and stopping the chip damage each turn."]
	quest.44A2C35534E51C9C.quest_desc: ["Restores a large amount of HP for tougher fights."]
	quest.44C2ABF85A99A9C9.quest_desc: ["Adds Special Defense EVs to a spread."]
	quest.44D4B1C50A9377B4.quest_desc: ["Halves one super-effective Bug-type hit, easing the Bug weakness of Psychic, Grass and Dark types."]
	quest.453EFE677418A0E5.quest_desc: [
		"Where else to find &aDragon type Pokemon&r but the End? Catch a Dragon type here."
		""
		"Dragon types are among the strongest partners in the game."
		""
		"A patient trainer earns a mighty ally."
	]
	quest.453EFE677418A0E5.quest_subtitle: "Tame a dragon of your own"
	quest.4756F5C74CF34221.quest_desc: ["Revives a fainted Pokemon with half its HP."]
	quest.4809D43C4E6C288E.quest_desc: ["Adds Attack EVs through a tasty treat."]
	quest.4863CD6DE6F03905.quest_desc: ["Restores about a quarter of max HP when the holder drops to half. The staple bulk-restoring held berry."]
	quest.4867E364EA0C8FF4.quest_desc: ["Boosts the power of super-effective moves by 20 percent."]
	quest.48A408C687168324.quest_desc: ["A shiny Utility+ Special Defense cap variant."]
	quest.49365102AE2D1F9B.quest_desc: ["A Utility+ golden cap that maxes an IV. The premium hyper-training tool."]
	quest.49CCC0D47FD56CC2.quest_desc: [
		"Collect every competitive held item and IV cap to build the perfect battle team."
		""
		"Reward: a random top-tier held item or IV tool plus a big XP payout."
	]
	quest.49CCC0D47FD56CC2.quest_subtitle: "Assemble every battle item"
	quest.49CCC0D47FD56CC2.title: "Battle Master"
	quest.4A090658157A4189.quest_desc: ["Wipes every EV off a Pokemon at once, giving you a clean slate to retrain."]
	quest.4A1DF984344BBB42.quest_desc: [
		"The &aMechanical Bearing&r rotates any structure attached to it. Use it to build windmills for power, or spinning contraptions for show."
		""
		"Attach blocks to its face, glue them together if needed, and give it rotation."
		""
		"Bearings and pistons together let you build machines that move themselves."
	]
	quest.4A1DF984344BBB42.quest_subtitle: "Spin blocks in place"
	quest.4B342B6226C513FC.quest_desc: ["Evolves Pokemon such as Togetic and Roselia."]
	quest.4B358F4AB4810D7F.quest_desc: [
		"The &aPackager&r wraps items into packages that travel on belts and through chutes, and can be addressed to a destination."
		""
		"Add a &aStock Ticker&r and &aStock Link&r to request items from a whole warehouse over the package network."
		""
		"Build a Packager and send your first addressed package across the base."
	]
	quest.4B358F4AB4810D7F.quest_subtitle: "Package logistics"
	quest.4B478508EF3A5998.quest_desc: ["Fully restores the PP of a single move."]
	quest.4BCA5AE6E024A7AF.quest_desc: ["Halves one super-effective Dark-type hit, guarding Psychic and Ghost types from Dark moves."]
	quest.4C51E3BC23133857.quest_desc: [
		"You have automation, control and trains. Now you build the &afull factory&r: superheated boilers, scheduled rail networks, package logistics, and the flying machines this pack adds on top of Create."
		""
		"This chapter uses the pack's Create addons: &aCreate Stuff \& Additions&r jetpacks, &aCreate Nuclear&r reactors and &aCreate Dragons Plus&r."
		""
		"Everything you make here runs on its own."
	]
	quest.4C51E3BC23133857.quest_subtitle: "The endgame of engineering"
	quest.4C6BC4837AADD3DC.quest_desc: ["Raises a Pokemon's HP IV toward its maximum."]
	quest.4CADC2E0A00608F9.quest_desc: ["A shiny scale that evolves Feebas into the elegant Milotic."]
	quest.4CD930E5A9CD764E.quest_desc: ["Changes a Pokemon's nature to Rash, reshaping its stat spread without re-breeding."]
	quest.4DB5E0E9EE60FE98.quest_desc: ["Lowers the Attack IV, handy for confusion or Foul Play sets."]
	quest.4DDB03D15837327F.quest_desc: [
		"Held items and perfect stats mean nothing without wins. It is time to test your team against the world."
		""
		"&aDefeat 100 Pokemon&r in battle, whether wild encounters or the teams of rival Trainers."
		""
		"A champion is forged in battle. Show everyone what your team can do."
	]
	quest.4DDB03D15837327F.quest_subtitle: "Prove your battle prowess"
	quest.4DE35413F57E7AAB.quest_desc: [
		"The &aChoice&r items lock you into a single move but grant a huge boost. They define aggressive competitive play."
		""
		"The &aChoice Band&r powers up physical attacks, the &aChoice Specs&r boost special attacks, and the &aChoice Scarf&r massively raises Speed."
		""
		"Collect the Choice trio to build fast, hard hitting sweepers."
	]
	quest.4DE35413F57E7AAB.quest_subtitle: "Commit to one move, gain raw power"
	quest.4E2A62BDF80DAE06.quest_desc: ["A Utility+ orb used to alter or transmute a Pokemon's traits."]
	quest.4E3C765D5CF8C1D7.quest_desc: ["Halves Speed but adds HP EVs after battle."]
	quest.4EBBBD704DFA5CC6.quest_desc: [
		"Every Pokemon has hidden &aIVs&r, values from 0 to 31 that decide how strong each stat can grow. Breeding is how you stack good IVs into a baby."
		""
		"The &aDestiny Knot&r is the key tool: give it to one parent and the Egg inherits five IVs from the two parents instead of three."
		""
		"Obtain a Destiny Knot and start breeding for perfect stats."
	]
	quest.4EBBBD704DFA5CC6.quest_subtitle: "Pass down the best stats"
	quest.4EF5FFCE28F5667C.quest_desc: [
		"Activate the End portal and step into the &aEnd&r."
		""
		"A barren island floats in the dark, guarded by a dragon."
		""
		"Bring blocks, bow and courage."
	]
	quest.4EF5FFCE28F5667C.quest_subtitle: "Into the void"
	quest.4F172B6977C1A903.quest_desc: ["A Utility+ void Special Attack cap."]
	quest.4F38DAAE2065535B.quest_desc: [
		"&aGravitite&r is the rarest Aether ore, floating upward when disturbed. Its tools levitate blocks."
		""
		"Mine and enchant &aGravitite Ore&r."
		""
		"The pinnacle of Aether mining."
	]
	quest.4F38DAAE2065535B.quest_subtitle: "Defy gravity"
	quest.4F5F09B688874FA5.quest_desc: ["A Utility+ cap that guarantees a high Defense IV floor."]
	quest.4F88C0D441510EFD.quest_desc: ["Restores a small amount of a Pokemon's HP out of battle."]
	quest.5000F94AD8C2D624.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to &aSteamon&r, a Create x Cobblemon community server."
		""
		"A few ground rules: no griefing, no stealing, no cheating or exploits. Be respectful in chat. Keep builds tasteful and give others space."
		""
		"Breaking these may cost you your whitelist. Play fair and everyone has a good time."
	]
	quest.5000F94AD8C2D624.quest_subtitle: "Play fair, be kind"
	quest.5000F94AD8C2D624.title: "Server Rules"
