	quest.50888E190728D8D6.quest_desc: [
		"Useful commands for getting around Steamon:"
		""
		"&a/tpa <player>&r  request to teleport to someone"
		"&a/tpaccept&r  accept a teleport request"
		"&a/back&r  return to your last location"
		"&a/spawn&r  travel to spawn"
		"&a/sethome&r  set a home point"
		"&a/home&r  return to a home"
		"&a/rtp&r  random teleport into the wild"
		"&a/warp <name>&r  travel to a named warp"
		""
		"&7Note: these commands require FTB Essentials (coming soon). They are listed here so you know what is on the way."
	]
