	quest.50F806FE920299D4.quest_desc: [
		"The &aCooking Pot&r is the heart of the kitchen. Set it over heat and simmer stews and soups from your harvest."
		""
		"Cook your first &aVegetable Soup&r, &aBeef Stew&r or &aNoodle Soup&r for lasting nourishment."
